# Formula/byway.rb lands here on the first `just release-cli` in the Byway repo.
# It is generated — the release renders it from a template with the version and
# the sha256 of the archive it just published, so anything committed here by
# hand is overwritten by the next release.
#
# This placeholder only exists so the directory is tracked before then; the
# release creates the directory anyway, so it can be deleted once a real formula
# is in place.
